<!--
  AntiCalling — ASP.NET Web Forms (.NET Framework 4.8) Web Application project.
  Lets the repo open and run in Visual Studio (F5 / IIS Express).
  Missing pieces from the bigger office app are stubbed under Stubs/ and
  SanjivaniBriefing/caller.Master so the project builds standalone.
  The Sanjivani flow (sip: call button + browser audio panel) works fully;
  office-only integrations (telephony API, office DB) are stubbed out.
-->
